{% if summary_cap %}
OUTPUT BUDGET: "summary" must stay under {{ summary_cap }} characters — it answers the task, it is not an essay. Full page text is attached by the system, so never retype it.
EXTRACT NAMED VALUES: prefer proper nouns, numbers and identifiers over yes/no statements. A fact like {"key": "form_filled", "value": "yes"} is worthless next to {"key": "product_name", "value": "WX-9"}. If the task names an entity, extract that entity.
