"article_candidates_considered": [{"url": "...", "rejected_reason": "..."}] — other article pages you saw and why they lost.
Pick the single most complete task-relevant article among the pages.
{% if summary_cap %}
The "article" block IS the answer here — do NOT restate its contents as "facts". Add a fact only for something the task asks about beyond the article itself. Retelling article sections as facts costs generation time and adds nothing.
